{
  "chain": "sales",
  "title": "一个销售单的跨表写入时序",
  "base_token_env": "FEISHU_V1_BITABLE_APP_TOKEN",
  "start": {
    "table": "销售主表",
    "order_field": "销售单号"
  },
  "tables": [
    {
      "key": "salesEntry",
      "label": "销售主表",
      "table": "销售主表",
      "role": "start"
    },
    {
      "key": "salesDetail",
      "label": "销售明细",
      "table": "销售明细",
      "role": "linked",
      "link_field": "销售单号",
      "from": "salesEntry"
    },
    {
      "key": "inventoryLedger",
      "label": "库存流水",
      "table": "库存流水",
      "role": "linked",
      "link_field": "关联销售",
      "from": "salesDetail"
    },
    {
      "key": "paymentRecord",
      "label": "S交易明细",
      "table": "S交易明细",
      "role": "linked",
      "link_field": "关联销售单",
      "from": "salesEntry"
    },
    {
      "key": "liveInventory",
      "label": "实时库存",
      "table": "实时库存",
      "role": "snapshot"
    }
  ],
  "phases": [
    {
      "name": "① 销售建单",
      "from": 0,
      "to": 28
    },
    {
      "name": "② 库存出库",
      "from": 58,
      "to": 88
    },
    {
      "name": "重试",
      "from": 93,
      "to": 107
    },
    {
      "name": "③ 资金收款",
      "from": 109,
      "to": 115
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "实时库存一条记录=一双鞋；出库后整条删除，接口无法回溯，只能由快照差集推断。",
    "本配置的 table_id 是生产表 ID；换 Base 时以 config 为准，不写死在脚本里。"
  ]
}
